\"><span>T\u00e9cnica terap\u00e9utica que consiste en la inserci\u00f3n de agujas finas para establecer el equilibrio del cuerpo, facilitando la circulaci\u00f3n de energ\u00eda, desencadenando efectos analg\u00e9sicos y antiinflamatorios para todo tipo de problemas f\u00edsicos o emocionales. <\/span><\/p>\n<p class=\"font_7\"><span>Ayuda especialmente a combatir problemas de estr\u00e9s y ansiedad, a luchar contra el tabaquismo y en tratamientos de p\u00e9rdida de peso.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_toggle][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\u00bb1_4&#8243; _builder_version=\u00bb4.16&#8243; custom_padding=\u00bb|||\u00bb global_colors_info=\u00bb{}\u00bb custom_padding__hover=\u00bb|||\u00bb][et_pb_blurb title=\u00bbMADEROTERAPIA\u00bb image=\u00bbhttps:\/\/quiromasajezaragoza.es\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/maderoterapia-andres-aldea-quiromasaje.png\u00bb image_icon_width_tablet=\u00bb200px\u00bb image_icon_width_phone=\u00bb200px\u00bb image_icon_width_last_edited=\u00bbon|tablet\u00bb _builder_version=\u00bb4.24.0&#8243; header_level=\u00bbh5&#8243; header_font=\u00bbCinzel||||||||\u00bb header_font_size=\u00bb24px\u00bb header_line_height=\u00bb1.2em\u00bb text_orientation=\u00bbcenter\u00bb animation=\u00bboff\u00bb hover_enabled=\u00bb0&#8243; border_radii_image=\u00bbon|500px|500px|500px|500px\u00bb border_width_all_image=\u00bb10px\u00bb border_color_all_image=\u00bbrgba(0,0,0,0)\u00bb box_shadow_style_image=\u00bbpreset1&#8243; box_shadow_vertical_image=\u00bb0px\u00bb box_shadow_blur_image=\u00bb0px\u00bb box_shadow_spread_image=\u00bb-20px\u00bb box_shadow_color_image=\u00bbrgba(0,0,0,0)\u00bb image_max_width_tablet=\u00bb200px\u00bb image_max_width_phone=\u00bb200px\u00bb image_max_width_last_edited=\u00bbon|tablet\u00bb global_colors_info=\u00bb{}\u00bb box_shadow_vertical_image__hover=\u00bb20px\u00bb box_shadow_vertical_image__hover_enabled=\u00bbon\u00bb box_shadow_blur_image__hover=\u00bb140px\u00bb box_shadow_blur_image__hover_enabled=\u00bbon\u